C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.4007/annals.2012.175.2.2\u0022\u003E10.4007/annals.2012.175.2.2\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Green%2C%20Ben\u0022\u003EBen Green\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Tao%2C%20Terence\u0022\u003ETerence Tao\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003ENew bounds for Szemer\u0026eacute;di\u0026rsquo;s theorem, III: A polylogarithmic bound for $r_4(N)$\u003C/em\u003E, Mathematika \u003Cstrong\u003E63\u003C/strong\u003E (2017), no.\u0026nbsp;3, 944\u0026ndash;1040.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=3731312\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E3731312\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1112/S0025579317000316\u0022\u003E10.1112/S0025579317000316\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Green%2C%20Ben\u0022\u003EBen Green\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Tao%2C%20Terence\u0022\u003ETerence Tao\u003C/a\u003E, and \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Ziegler%2C%20Tamar\u0022\u003ETamar Ziegler\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EAn inverse theorem for the Gowers $U^4$-norm\u003C/em\u003E, Glasg. Math. J. \u003Cstrong\u003E53\u003C/strong\u003E (2011), no.\u0026nbsp;1, 1\u0026ndash;50.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=2747135\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E2747135\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1017/S0017089510000546\u0022\u003E10.1017/S0017089510000546\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Green%2C%20Ben\u0022\u003