%20Benjamin\u0022\u003EBenjamin Weiss\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EA mean ergodic theorem for $(1/N)\\sum ^N_{n=1}f(T^nx)g(T^{n^2}x)$\u003C/em\u003E, Convergence in ergodic theory and probability (Columbus, OH, 1993) Ohio State Univ. Math. Res. Inst. Publ., vol.\u0026nbsp;5, de Gruyter, Berlin, 1996, pp.\u0026nbsp;193\u0026ndash;227.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1412607\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E1412607\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Gowers%2C%20W.%20T.\u0022\u003EW. T. Gowers\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EA new proof of Szemer\u0026eacute;di\u0026rsquo;s theorem for arithmetic progressions of length four\u003C/em\u003E, Geom. Funct. Anal. \u003Cstrong\u003E8\u003C/strong\u003E (1998), no.\u0026nbsp;3, 529\u0026ndash;551.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1631259\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E1631259\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1007/s000390050065\u0022\u003E10.1007/s000390050065\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/search/authors.html?authorName=Gowers%2C%20W.%20T.\u0022\u003EW. T. Gowers\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Cem\u003EA new proof of Szemer\u0026eacute;di\u0026rsquo;s theorem\u003C/em\u003E, Geom. Funct. Anal. \u003Cstrong\u003E11\u003C/strong\u003E (2001), no.\u0026nbsp;3, 465\u0026ndash;588.  \u003Ca href=\u0022https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1844079\u0022\u003EMR \u003Cstrong\u003E1844079\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/a\u003E, DOI \u003Ca href=\u0022https://doi.org/10.1007/s00039-001-0332-9\u0022\u003E10.1007/s00039-001-0332-9\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\n\n\n\u003Cli\u003E B. Green and M. Sawhney, \u003Cem\u003EPrimes of the form $p^2\u002Bnq^2$\u003C/em\u003E, Preprint, arXiv:\u003Ca href=\u0022https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.04189\u0022\u