<div class='productDetailSubscriptionTabHeader'>Articles in press</div><div class='productDetailSubscriptionTabSubheader'><div>Papers are displayed alphabetically by first author listed<br>Early View PDF articles are an AMS member benefit</div></div>    <div class="productDetailSubscriptionTabInfo"><ul><li id='articleContent_91253' data-ams-pii='BULL1893'><div class='productDetailTitle'>Local combinatorial formulas for the signature</div><div><a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Cheeger%2C%20Jeff' target='_blank'>Jeff Cheeger</a></div><div></div><li id='articleContent_91254' data-ams-pii='BULL1897'><div class='productDetailTitle'>Jim Simons: His work and its impact</div><div><a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Cheeger%2C%20Jeff' target='_blank'>Jeff Cheeger</a> and <a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Lawson%2C%20H.' target='_blank'>H. Blaine Lawson, Jr.</a></div><div></div><li id='articleContent_91255' data-ams-pii='BULL1894'><div class='productDetailTitle'>Peronal reminiscences of the Yang-Simons seminar, which was a historical turning point</div><div><a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Lawson%2C%20H.' target='_blank'>H. Blaine Lawson</a></div><div></div><li id='articleContent_91256' data-ams-pii='BULL1895'><div class='productDetailTitle'>Chern-Simons theory, holography and topological strings</div><div><a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Vafa%2C%20Cumrun' target='_blank'>Cumrun Vafa</a></div><div></div><li id='articleContent_91257' data-ams-pii='BULL1896'><div class='productDetailTitle'>The Chern-Simons function and the quantum Hall effect</div><div><a href='https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/authors-search?query=Witten%2C%20Edward' target='_blank'>Edward Witten</a></div><div></div><li id='articleContent_91259' data-ams-pii='BULL1898'><div class='productDetailTitle'>Gauge theory in pure mathematics</div><